papers/116-max-plus-switching-induced-growth/HOSTILE_REVIEW_A.md:16:The exact pair-specific formulas remain viable after these repairs, but the owner subtraction is materially incomplete. Finite projective reductions, induced Markov chains, mean performance of max-plus automata, Bernoulli max-plus Lyapunov exponents, and randomly switching max-plus systems all have direct primary owners that are not presently cited. Search absence is not novelty. External circulation must remain on hold.
